    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper struct that represents how a value is partially mapped into a register. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The StartIdx and Length represent what region of the orginal value this partial mapping covers. This can be represented as a Mask of contiguous bit starting at StartIdx bit and spanning Length bits. StartIdx is the number of bits from the less significant bits. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
